Since April, people have reported bookings landing on the wrong day. By 4 October, the desk
had merged the reports into #4471. The export overlaps some report IDs, so the table counts
each unique report once.

The merge contains two causes, not one. Classify reports by tenant configuration and channel;
the intake tag is only a guess.

